@startuml
title UC-01 - Create / Configure Application (client-owned draft) - future editor, not MVP fixture path
autonumber
hide footbox
actor Developer
boundary "Web UI" as UI
control "Application API / Controller" as API
control "Application Service" as Service
control "Application Definition Validator" as Validator
entity "Application Repository" as AppRepo
control "Application Specification Generator" as SpecGenerator
entity "Specification Repository /\nConfig Repo Service" as SpecRepo

note over UI, Service
  ApplicationDefinitionDraft is owned by Web UI. Every edit request carries
  the complete draft and returns its replacement. API and Service retain no
  applicationDraft between requests.
end note
Developer -> UI: Create application or open existing application
alt Create
  UI -> API: createApplication(name, description)
  API -> Service: createApplication(name, description)
  Service --> API: ApplicationDefinitionDraft
else Update
  UI -> API: updateApplication(applicationId)
  API -> Service: updateApplication(applicationId)
  Service -> AppRepo: findById(applicationId)
  AppRepo --> Service: Application Definition
  Service --> API: ApplicationDefinitionDraft
end
API --> UI: Store draft locally

Developer -> UI: Edit resources, workloads, definitions and dependencies
UI -> API: addResourceRequirement(applicationDraft, resources)
API -> Service: addResourceRequirement(applicationDraft, resources)
Service --> API: Updated ApplicationDefinitionDraft
API --> UI: Replace local draft
UI -> API: addWorkload(applicationDraft, workloads)
API -> Service: addWorkload(applicationDraft, workloads)
Service --> API: Updated ApplicationDefinitionDraft
API --> UI: Replace local draft
UI -> API: defineConfigurationRequirement(applicationDraft, requirements)
API -> Service: defineConfigurationRequirement(applicationDraft, requirements)
Service --> API: Updated ApplicationDefinitionDraft
API --> UI: Replace local draft
UI -> API: defineDependency(applicationDraft, dependencies)
API -> Service: defineDependency(applicationDraft, dependencies)
Service --> API: Updated ApplicationDefinitionDraft
API --> UI: Display topology from local draft

Developer -> UI: Save Application
UI -> API: saveApplicationDefinition(applicationDraft)
API -> Service: saveApplicationDefinition(applicationDraft)
Service -> Validator: validateApplicationDefinition(applicationDraft)
Validator --> Service: Valid
Service -> AppRepo: save(applicationDefinition)
AppRepo --> Service: Saved definition
Service -> SpecGenerator: generateApplicationSpecification(applicationDefinition)
SpecGenerator --> Service: Application specification
Service -> SpecRepo: save(applicationSpecification)
SpecRepo --> Service: Saved
Service --> API: Application saved
API --> UI: Show confirmation
@enduml
